KidGPT ("Software", "KidGPT", "Sparkle Tutor", or "the Project") is a bilingual Vietnamese/English AI study buddy designed for children aged 6–12.

This license applies to the source code of the KidGPT repository, including the frontend, backend/API code, configuration, documentation, and other original materials contained in this repository, unless a file or component is explicitly identified as being subject to a different license.

